\newlabel{tab:decoupling}{{2}{4}{Cross-family decoupling spectrum. GRPO QLoRA produces catastrophic decoupling in both Qwen3 (rel\_F1=1.38) and LLaMA (rel\_F1=1.5), confirming decoupling is architecture-independent. RSFT shows no decoupling in either family}{table.2}{}}
